CM_ BO_ 2566834688  "Source: AgIsoStack++ can_general_parameter_group_numbers.hpp:47. DM1 carries Active Diagnostic Trouble Codes per SAE J1939-73. Payload layout (multi-DTC, variable length): byte 0 = lamp status (MIL / Red Stop / Amber Warning / Protect, 2 bits each); byte 1 = flash status for those 4 lamps; bytes 2+ = repeating 4-byte DTC records (SPN 19-bit + FMI 5-bit + OC 7-bit + CM 1-bit). Per-DTC decoding is reader-side; this DBC documents only the frame-level definition. Public reference: CSS Electronics J1939-73 explainer (csselectronics.com). Full decode contribution welcome — see CONTRIBUTING.md.";
